# Job Number timeline (Admin)

Owner-only `/job-timeline?job=`. Typed search. No Job Number catalog.

## Workspace

Do not start Admin enhancement until JTE-03 is `complete`.
Orientation: [`uxdocs/HANDOFF-job-timeline-enhancement.md`](../../uxdocs/HANDOFF-job-timeline-enhancement.md).
Issues live in `vantage-main-server/docs/job-number-timeline/`.

## Render, do not evaluate

Display `current_outcome`, `stage_assessments`, `attention`, and
`limitations` from the server. Density filters hide rows only. Activity
groups must not drop events. Official Booking and official Cancellation
stay independently visible.

This folder mounts `JobTimelinePage` from
`GET /api/v1/admin/job-number-timeline`. Do not mount forensic
`components/granot-lifecycle/job-timeline.tsx` here.

## Invariants

- Keep `buildJobTimelineHref` / `?job=` as shareable state.
- Keep `queryKeys.jobNumberTimeline` isolated from `granotLifecycle`.
- v1 fixtures remain renderable while `schema_version` is absent.
- Locked headlines stay locked. No raw JSON. No contact.
- Sheet `synced` is never “Google verified”.
- Owner-only at `OWNER_ONLY_PAGE_PREFIXES` and `canProxyVantagePath`.
